.\n3. Go to Company cards.\n4. Go to Categories/any other page.\n5. Go to Company cards.\n\n## Expected Result:\nIn Step 5, Company cards page will not load each time opening it.\n\n## Actual Result:\nIn Step 5, Company cards page loads each time opening it.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a9630d7-0171-4970-a0d4-47b19aab96a1\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065365683893732639\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022065365683893732639</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2065365683893732639</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-03</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @nkdengineer</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93404/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782","id":4195435600,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa876EURQ","number":2782,"title":"[ONBOARD: 1 RTC] Review an Open PR","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115029430,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1358,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:41:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:16:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 2 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nHelp us review code. Every PR benefits from a second pair of eyes.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Pick any open PR** from [Rustchain](https://github.com/Scottcjn/Rustchain/pulls), [BoTTube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube/pulls), or [rustchain-bounties](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/pulls)\n2. **Read the code changes** (click \"Files changed\" tab)\n3. **Leave a substantive review comment**. Examples:\n   - \"Line 42: this SQL query isn't parameterized, potential injection\"\n   - \"This function duplicates logic already in utils.py line 80\"\n   - \"Missing error handling if the API returns non-200\"\n   - \"Good approach, but the variable name should describe what it holds\"\n4. **Comment here** with a link to your review\n\n### What Counts\n- Review must be **technical and specific** (not \"looks good\" or \"nice work\")\n- Point to specific lines with specific observations\n- Positive observations count too (\"good use of context manager here\")\n- You don't need to be an expert. Asking good questions is reviewing.\n\n### Payment\n2 RTC once your review contains at least 2 substantive observations.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy-Medium | **Time**: 20-40 min | **Skills**: Can read Python or JavaScript\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/reactions","total_count":12,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2782/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92364/labels{/name}","c