pp Component:** Workspace Settings\n\n## Action Performed:\nPrecondition \nuse Expensifail account\n\n1. Go to https://staging.new.expensify.com/\n2. Create CONTROL workspace\n3. Go to workflows > click Add approval Workflow > Navigate back\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe Add Approval Workflow button should open the next screen immediately without delay, and when navigating back the Workflows page should retain and display the correct workflow state consistently.\n\n## Actual Result:\nThe Add Approval Workflow button responds with a noticeable delay, and after navigating back the Workflows page displays an inconsistent or incorrect workflow state.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db31ad7f-f973-4bd2-b485-ec8b5c5f8457\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Mita Rachim\n> Bug ID: 7192514\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022071527287895079092\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022071527287895079092</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2071527287895079092</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-06</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94758/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94758/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92108","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensif