 QBD page normally after the redirect\n\n## Actual Result:\nNo response on the Accounting page\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25d10beb-352b-435e-af9d-23d38b0b69aa\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022054389637126141168</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2054389637126141168</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-17</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @truph01</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88977/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/88977/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76526","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76526/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76526/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76526/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/76526","id":3685759095,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7bsDh3","number":76526,"title":"[$250] Attachments - Long image becomes permanently blurred when download icon appears","user":{"login":"jponikarchuk","id":141990088,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHaYyA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141990088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","