al Team\n**Device used:** Android\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Launch the app Expensify\n2. Open any conversation 1:1\n3. Tap on \"+\" and \"Add attachment\"\n4. Tap on the preview \n5. Zoom it and wait for the \"Download icon\" appears\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe user should be able to view the long image in full resolution and zoom in/out clearly, regardless of when the download icon appears.\n\n## Actual Result:\nWhen the download icon finally appears, the long image suddenly becomes blurred and remains low resolution, preventing the user from viewing or zooming the image clearly.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [x] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n- [ ] MacOS: Desktop\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57f82aa5-dde2-4327-85f1-aeea7675555e\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/592c8e49-848d-4aae-90c4-55e349664721)\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~021998372578082250221</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 1998372578082250221</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-30</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @akinwale</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76526/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/76526/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287","id":2878804793,"node_id":"I_kwDOI9Wqc86rlxM5","number":18287,"title":"[Bounty $2500] Bring up microsoft/phi-1 on Wormhole","user":{"login":"thenoahhein","id":60185486,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMTg1NDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60185486?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenoahhein","html_url":"https://github.com/thenoahhein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenoahhein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenoahhein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenoahhein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenoahhein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenoahhein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenoahhein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenoahhein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenoahhein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thenoahhein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":7931645110,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAAB2MNMtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":null},{"id":7931705964,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAAB2MQ6bA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/labels/bounty_difficulty/hard","name":"bounty_difficulty/hard","color":"C6BB20","default":false,"description":"Hard Bounty"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"Adraca","id":256321285,"node_id":"U_kgDOD0cnBQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256321285?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca","html_url":"https://github.com/Adraca","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":104,"created_at":"2025-02-25T15:39:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T21:53:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"Adraca","id":256321285,"node_id":"U_kgDOD0cnBQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256321285?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca","html_url":"https://github.com/Adraca","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Adraca/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"# Bounty $500-2500 Bring up microsoft/phi-1 on Wormhole (N150/N300)\n\n## 📝 Background\n\nThis bounty is for enabling and validating the `microsoft/phi-1` language model on Tenstorrent’s Wormhole hardware. Phi-1 is a transformer-based LLM designed with efficiency and compactness for code and text tasks, making it attractive for research, developers, and edge deployments. By running Phi-1 on Tenstorrent hardware, we aim to demonstrate practical inference, benchmark performance, and establish a production-grade implementation for community use.\n\n## 🎯 What Success Looks Like\n\nTo claim this bounty, contributors must complete all three stages below:\n\n### Stage 1 - Bring Up\n\n- The `microsoft/phi-1` model must compile and run end-to-end inference on Wormhole (N150/N300) with no blocking errors.\n- The model produces coherent output for text generation tasks\n- Integrate `phi-1` support into our [model directory](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/tree/main/models/demos), maintain the same coding style as used in TT repository and measure performance (see [current benchmarks](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/blob/main/models/tt_transformers/PERF.md))\n- Include a simple demo script to run inference and show output.\n\n### Stage 2 - Basic Optimizations\n\n- Store temporary results in L1 memory when possible.\n- Fuse activation functions directly after matmul operations.\n- Apply sharding to tensors where applicable.\n- Leverage existing tt-transformers base modules (avoid duplicating code).\n- Document any parameter tuning or known issues.\n\n### Stage 3 - Deeper Optimization\n\n- Adapt model to exploit TT hardware features, e.g.:\n    - Employ SDPA operator for efficient attention computation.\n    - Minimize unnecessary tensor moves by reordering computation steps.\n- Refactor for modularity and internal code reuse, following production standards.\n\n## 🧭 Guidance & Starting Points\n\n- Use the tt-transformers base in `tt-metal/models/tt_transformers` for model implementation; reuse existing modules where possible.\n- Reference the [model bring up guide](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/blob/main/models/model_bring_up.md#model-bring-up).\n- Avoid full codebase duplication—implement in a clean, maintainable way.\n\n## 🔎 Possible Approaches\n\n- Start from an existing transformer implementation in tt-transformers (Llama/Qwen) and adapt for Phi-1.\n- Use modular inheritance to minimize code changes.\n- Profile bottlenecks, optimize memory layout, and use TTNN/tt-metal profiling tools.\n- Reach out in issues or discussions for hardware-specific advice.\n\n## 📊 Result Submission Guidelines Notes\n\nBeyond the model implementation itself, contributors must submit the following proof of work. Feel free to open a PR at any stage for feedback, but payout is only made after all 3 stages are completed.\n\n* Functional model implementation\n* Validation logs showing output correctness and accuracy\n* Performance report + perf header for final review\n\nThe performance report generated will be used as a key piece of information for us to decide if the program is reasonably performant. \n\nLinks:\n- [Link to perf sheet](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/blob/main/tech_reports/ttnn/TTNN-model-bringup.md#41-performance-sheet)\n- [Perf header](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/tt-metal/latest/ttnn/ttnn/profiling_ttnn_operations.html#perf-report-headers)\n\nFor reference our estimated max throughput for phi-1 is 141 tokens/sec/user on Wormhole. A\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources\n\n- [tt-transformers base](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/tree/main/models/tt_transformers)\n- [Model bring up guide](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/blob/main/models/model_bring_up.md#model-bring-up)\n- [Phi-1 original paper](https://phi-1-model.github.io/) (if available)\n- [Reference implementation](https://github.com/microsoft/phi-1)\n- [Performance benchmarks](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/blob/main/models/tt_transformers/PERF.md)\n- [Discussion for help](https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/discussions)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92412/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/92412","id":4574194908,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABEKSs3A","number":92412,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-07-07] [$250] [Sentry: APP-25V] HybridApp iOS EXC_BAD_ACCESS in RuntimeScheduler_Modern::runEventLoopTick","user":{"login":"mountiny","id":36083550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDgzNTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36083550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny","html_url":"https://github.com/mountiny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/repos","events_url":"h